{
  "name": "ldt_headed — ACI 318-19 25.4.4 headed #8: applicability pass with hand-computed ldt, and a rejected config (AUDIT-FIXES A3/A4, H2)",
  "comments": {
    "hand": [
      "Applicable run: 4-#8 headed in b_gb 24, covers 3/2/2, Abrg = 4Ab (default). 25.4.4.1 checks:",
      "  db = 1.0 <= #11 OK; Abrg >= 4Ab OK; clear cover min(3, 2) = 2 >= 2db = 2 OK;",
      "  clear bar spacing = (24-4-1)/3 - 1 = 5.33333 >= 4db = 4 OK -> applicable.",
      "psi_p (Table 25.4.4.3): headed-bar c/c spacing s = (24-4-1)/3 = 6.33333 >= 6db = 6.0 -> psi_p = 1.0 via disjunct (b).",
      "ldt = (60000 * psi_e(1.0) * psi_p(1.0) * psi_o(1.25) * psi_c(0.8) / (75*sqrt(3000))) * 1.0^1.5",
      "    = 60000/4107.9191813 = 14.6059349 in >= max(8db, 6) -> 14.6059349 in. (75*54.7722558 = 4107.9191813.)",
      "Rejected run: same but b_gb 16 -> clear bar spacing = (16-4-1)/3 - 1 = 2.66667 < 4db = 4 -> 25.4.4.1 NOT met;",
      "engine must reject headed use: anchorage row state 'detailing does not fit', pass = false."
    ]
  },
  "runs": [
    {
      "name": "applicable",
      "inputs": {
        "geometry": { "L_w_ft": 28.5, "x_L_ft": 1.25, "x_R_ft": 27.25, "lb_L_in": 30, "lb_R_in": 30, "t_w_in": 12, "h_w_ft": 14, "h_gb_in": 24, "b_gb_in": 24 },
        "loads": { "DL_super_plf": 5525, "LL_plf": 5205 },
        "materials": { "fc_psi": 3000, "fy_ksi": 60 },
        "reinf": { "tieBars": { "count": 4, "size": "#8" }, "topBars": { "count": 4, "size": "#8" }, "cover_bot_in": 3, "cover_side_in": 2, "cover_top_in": 2,
          "web": { "size": "#4", "s_in": 12, "layers": 2 },
          "anchorage": { "left": { "type": "headed" }, "right": { "type": "headed" } } }
      },
      "expect": { "status": "ok", "values": [
        { "path": "checks[id=anchorage.L].state", "value": "ok" },
        { "path": "checks[id=anchorage.L].contributions[0].ldt.applicable", "value": true },
        { "path": "checks[id=anchorage.L].contributions[0].ldt.psiP", "value": 1, "atol": 0, "note": "disjunct (b): headed-bar c/c s = 6.33333 >= 6db" },
        { "path": "checks[id=anchorage.L].demand", "value": 14.60593486680443, "rtol": 1e-9, "note": "hand: 60000/4107.9191813 * 1.0^1.5 = 14.6059349 in" }
      ] }
    },
    {
      "name": "rejected_clear_spacing",
      "inputs": {
        "geometry": { "L_w_ft": 28.5, "x_L_ft": 1.25, "x_R_ft": 27.25, "lb_L_in": 30, "lb_R_in": 30, "t_w_in": 12, "h_w_ft": 14, "h_gb_in": 24, "b_gb_in": 16 },
        "loads": { "DL_super_plf": 5525, "LL_plf": 5205 },
        "materials": { "fc_psi": 3000, "fy_ksi": 60 },
        "reinf": { "tieBars": { "count": 4, "size": "#8" }, "topBars": { "count": 4, "size": "#8" }, "cover_bot_in": 3, "cover_side_in": 2, "cover_top_in": 2,
          "web": { "size": "#4", "s_in": 12, "layers": 2 },
          "anchorage": { "left": { "type": "headed" }, "right": { "type": "headed" } } }
      },
      "expect": { "status": "ok", "values": [
        { "path": "checks[id=anchorage.L].state", "value": "detailing does not fit", "note": "25.4.4.1 clear spacing 2.66667 < 4db -> headed use rejected, not silently allowed" },
        { "path": "checks[id=anchorage.L].pass", "value": false },
        { "path": "checks[id=anchorage.L].contributions[0].ldt.applicable", "value": false }
      ] }
    }
  ]
}
